        "original_id": "bc4d8c47-894f-5ef2-aa1b-45480eacc580",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: A Perfect Murder, Dial M for Murder, 3 A.M., Gloria, For Real\n- People: Andrew Davis, Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, Viggo Mortensen, Alfred Hitchcock, Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, John Williams, Sarita Choudhury\n\nFacts:\n- Dial M for Murder is a 1954 American crime mystery film directed by Alfred Hitchcock and starring Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, and John Williams.\n- In the late 1990s, Sarita Choudhury had supporting roles in A Perfect Murder, 3 A.M., and Gloria.\n- A Perfect Murder is a 1998 American crime thriller film directed by Andrew Davis and starring Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, and Viggo Mortensen.\n- In For Real, a girl believes that her mother, played by Sarita Choudhury, is an alien from the Orion galaxy who replaced her real mother because of family discord.",
